MB (needs a quota increase): up to 6 vCPUs reported, share still continuous\n- More runtimes: NumPy/OpenBLAS, PyTorch (container image), Node.js libuv\n- OpenWhisk on Kubernetes with CPU pinning (cpuset)\n- Gang scheduling: asynchronous invocation, larger N, Step Functions Map\n- GPU actions on self-hosted OpenWhisk: the scheduler only accounts for memory\n- Limits so far: one AWS region, 3008 MB, concurrency 10, single-node OpenWhisk"}}, {"createSlide": {"objectId": "pe_cpus", "slideLayoutReference": {"layoutId": "g3cdb972c672_2_13"}, "placeholderIdMappings": [{"layoutPlaceholder": {"type": "TITLE", "index": 0}, "objectId": "pe_cpus_title"}, {"layoutPlaceholder": {"type": "BODY", "index": 0}, "objectId": "pe_cpus_body"}]}}, {"insertText": {"objectId": "pe_cpus_title", "text": "Lambda Shows 2 CPUs but Grants as Little as 0.08"}}, {"insertText": {"objectId": "pe_cpus_body", "text": "- CPU share = memory / 1769 MB, enforced outside the VM\n- Inside the function: always 2 vCPUs, no cgroup limit visible\n- Thread pools size themselves from what they see\n\t- OpenMP and ONNX Runtime: 2 threads on Lambda\n\t- ONNX Runtime ignores the affinity mask: 32 threads when pinned to 2 of 32 CPUs"}}, {"createImage": {"objectId": "pe_cpus_fig", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/anileren5/serverless-benchmarks/4003b38dcd055f02789ca515b740a9d8fc38003e/results/slides/slide_effective_cpus.png", "elementProperties": {"pageObjectId": "pe_cpus", "size": {"width": {"magnitude": 5669280, "unit": "EMU"}, "height": {"magnitude": 3566160, "unit": "EMU"}}, "transform": {"scaleX": 1, "scaleY": 1, "shearX": 0, "shearY": 0, "translateX": 320040, "translateY": 914400, "unit": "EMU"}}}}, {"createSlide": {"objectId": "pe_storm", "slideLayoutReference": {"layoutId": "g3cdb972c672_2_13"}, "placeholderIdMappings": [{"layoutPlaceholder": {"type": "TITLE", "index": 0}, "objectId": "pe_storm_title"}, {"layoutPlaceholder": {"type": "BODY", "index": 0}, "objectId": "pe_storm_body"}]}}, {"insertText": {"objectId": "pe_storm_title", "text": "Spinning Threads Burn the CPU Share: up to 58x Slower"}}, {"insertText": {"objectId": "pe_storm_body", "text": "- OpenMP Jacobi, same total work, one barrier per sweep\n- Idle threads busy-wait at the barrier and use the share the working thread needs\n- 128 MB: long runs with 2 threads hit the 300 s timeout\n- OMP_WAIT_POLICY=passive: 9.2 s to 4.7 s at 128 MB\n- 4 threads only 1.1-2.5x: libgomp stops spinning above the reported CPUs"}}, {"createImage": {"objectId": "pe_storm_fig", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/anileren5/serverless-benchmarks/4003b38dcd055f02789ca515b740a9d8fc38003e/results/slides/slide_barrier_storm.png", "elementProperties": {"pageObjectId": "pe_storm", "size": {"width": {"magnitude": 5669280, "unit": "EMU"}, "height": {"magnitude": 3566160, "unit": "EMU"}}, "transform": {"scaleX": 1, "scaleY": 1, "shearX": 0, "shearY": 0, "translateX": 320040, "translateY": 914400, "unit": "EMU"}}}}, {"createSlide": {"objectId": "pe_onnx", "slideLayoutReference": {"layoutId": "g3cdb972c672_2_13"}, "placeholderIdMappings": [{"layoutPlaceholder": {"type": "TITLE", "index": 0}, "objectId": "pe_onnx_title"}, {"layoutPlaceholder": {"type": "BODY", "index": 0}, "objectId": "pe_onnx_body"}]}}, {"insertText": {"objectId": "pe_onnx_title", "text": "ResNet-50 on ONNX Runtime: Spinning Workers Cost up to 6x"}}, {"insertText": {"objectId": "pe_onnx_body", "text": "- Lambda 640-3008 MB (band: range across sizes)\n- Default 2 threads costs 16-34% up to 1769 MB; 1 thread is fastest\n- OpenWhisk, 4-CPU quota: default 32 threads, 11x slower alone, 18x with 8 co-located actions\n- allow_spinning = 0: within 1.25x of the best at every thread count"}}, {"createImage": {"objectId": "pe_onnx_fig", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/anileren5/serverless-benchmarks/4003b38dcd055f02789ca515b740a9d8fc38003e/results/slides/slide_onnx.png", "elementProperties": {"pageObjectId": "pe_onnx", "size": {"width": {"magnitude": 5669280, "unit": "EMU"}, "height": {"magnitude": 3566160, "unit": "EMU"}}, "transform": {"scaleX": 1, "scaleY": 1, "shearX": 0, "shearY": 0, "translateX": 320040, "translateY": 914400, "unit": "EMU"}}}}, {"createSlide": {"objectId": "pe_gang", "slideLayoutReference": {"layoutId": "g3cdb972c672_2_13"}, "placeholderIdMappings": [{"layoutPlaceholder": {"type": "TITLE", "index": 0}, "objectId": "pe_gang_title"}, {"layoutPlaceholder": {"type": "BODY", "index": 0}, "objectId": "pe_gang_body"}]}}, {"insertText": {"objectId": "pe_gang_title", "text": "Gang Scheduling: Synchronous Jobs Deadlock Above the Concurrency Cap"}}, {"insertText": {"objectId": "pe_gang_body", "text": "- Cap = account concurrency (Lambda) or invoker memory / action memory (OpenWhisk: 8192 MB / 1024 MB = 8); predicted all 60 launches\n- FMI (Copik et al., ICS '23) assumes all ranks run at once. Below the cap, ranks still spend 40-83% of their time at barriers"}}, {"createImage": {"objectId": "pe_gang_fig", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/anileren5/serverless-benchmarks/4003b38dcd055f02789ca515b740a9d8fc38003e/results/slides/slide_gang_scheduling.png", "elementProperties": {"pageObjectId": "pe_gang", "size": {"width": {"magnitude": 7680960, "unit": "EMU"}, "height": {"magnitude": 3089081, "unit": "EMU"}}, "transform": {"scaleX": 1, "scaleY": 1, "shearX": 0, "shearY": 0, "translateX": 548640, "translateY": 822960, "unit": "EMU"}}}}, {"updateSlidesPosition": {"slideObjectIds": ["pe_section"], "insertionIndex": 18}}, {"updateSlidesPosition": {"slideObjectIds": ["pe_sofar"], "insertionIndex": 18}}, {"updateSlidesPosition": {"slideObjectIds": ["pe_cpus"], "insertionIndex": 18}}, {"updateSlidesPosition": {"slideObjectIds": ["pe_storm"], "insertionIndex": 18}}, {"updateSlidesPosition": {"slideObjectIds": ["pe_onnx"], "insertionIndex": 18}}, {"updateSlidesPosition": {"slideObjectIds": ["pe_gang"], "insertionIndex": 18}}, {"updateSlidesPosition": {"slideObjectIds": ["pe_next"], "insertionIndex": 18}}], "writeControl": {"requiredRevisionId": "YsRa1l936hnWLg"}}